{"id":"9ff05b6487475241","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-p-fo-lfp.md","title":"P=FO(LFP)定理","display":"thm-p-fo-lfp — P=FO(LFP)定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-p-fo-lfp","aliases":["29-thm-p-fo-lfp"],"display":"thm-p-fo-lfp — P=FO(LFP)定理","depends_on":["[[29-thm-immerman-vardi]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-fo-lfp]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 4.10, p.60, DjVu scan 75","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-p-fo-lfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-p-fo-lfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-p-fo-lfp — P=FO(LFP)定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e1064efb9350fb3\" href=\"?note=9e1064efb9350fb3\" title=\"29-thm-immerman-vardi\">29-thm-immerman-vardi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 4.10, p.60, DjVu scan 75"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span>；所有查询都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{P}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{P}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau^{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)},&lt;}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}_\\tau^{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)},&lt;}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>，满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{P}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{P}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 4.10，印刷页 60，扫描页 75。已核对该页证明：正 LFP 至多进行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^k\">\\(n^k\\)</span> 轮 FO 求值；反向用一阶归约到交替可达性。域必须有内建序。三个历史入口保留同一结果，未将其计为三个独立定理的数学贡献。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-thm-immerman-vardi","status":"resolved","id":"9e1064efb9350fb3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-immerman-vardi]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved",